usage: uLTRA index [-h] [--min_segm MIN_SEGM] [--flank_size FLANK_SIZE]
                   [--small_exon_threshold SMALL_EXON_THRESHOLD]
                   [--disable_infer] [--thinning THINNING] [--s S]
                   ref gtf outfolder

positional arguments:
  ref                   Reference genome (fasta)
  gtf                   Path to gtf or gtf file with gene models.
  outfolder             Path to output folder.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --min_segm MIN_SEGM   Threshold for minimum segment size considered.
  --flank_size FLANK_SIZE
                        Size of genomic regions surrounding genes.
  --small_exon_threshold SMALL_EXON_THRESHOLD
                        Considered in MAM solution even if they cont contain
                        MEMs.
  --disable_infer       Makes splice creation step much faster. Thes parameter
                        can be set if gene and transcript name fields are
                        provided in gtf file.
  --thinning THINNING   Seed thinning level 0-2: 0 (deactivated, default) 1
                        (in expectation every third base) or 2 (in expectation
                        every fifth base). Thinning makes seedins step much
                        faster and less memory consuming at cost of accuracy.
  --s S                 Strobe size (default s=10). Uses strobemers of (2, s,
                        s+1, 35).
